// Prisma schema khớp với server/supabase/migrations (nguồn sự thật là SQL migration).
// Partial unique index, unique theo lower(name), CHECK và trigger updated_at chỉ có trong DB.
// Không chạy `prisma migrate` trên DB này; đổi schema bằng migration SQL qua Supabase MCP.
// Docs: https://pris.ly/d/prisma-schema

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

datasource db {
  provider = "postgresql"
}

enum UserRole {
  reader
  librarian
  admin

  @@map("user_role")
}

enum UserStatus {
  pending
  active
  disabled

  @@map("user_status")
}

enum BorrowStatus {
  pending
  borrowing
  returned
  rejected
  cancelled

  @@map("borrow_status")
}

enum ReturnStatus {
  pending
  confirmed
  rejected
  cancelled

  @@map("return_status")
}

enum BookCondition {
  normal
  damaged
  lost

  @@map("book_condition")
}

enum FineType {
  late
  damaged
  lost

  @@map("fine_type")
}

enum FineStatus {
  unpaid
  pending
  paid
  rejected

  @@map("fine_status")
}

model User {
  id              Int        @id @default(autoincrement())
  email           String     @unique @db.VarChar(255)
  passwordHash    String     @map("password_hash") @db.VarChar(255)
  name            String     @db.VarChar(50)
  phone           String?    @db.VarChar(15)
  address         String?    @db.VarChar(255)
  avatarPath      String?    @map("avatar_path") @db.VarChar(255)
  role            UserRole   @default(reader)
  status          UserStatus @default(pending)
  emailVerifiedAt DateTime?  @map("email_verified_at") @db.Timestamptz
  createdAt       DateTime   @default(now()) @map("created_at") @db.Timestamptz
  updatedAt       DateTime   @default(now()) @map("updated_at") @db.Timestamptz

  emailVerificationTokens EmailVerificationToken[]
  borrowOrders            BorrowOrder[]            @relation("BorrowOrderReader")
  processedBorrowOrders   BorrowOrder[]            @relation("BorrowOrderProcessor")
  requestedReturns        ReturnRequest[]          @relation("ReturnRequestRequester")
  processedReturns        ReturnRequest[]          @relation("ReturnRequestProcessor")
  fineTickets             FineTicket[]             @relation("FineTicketReader")
  issuedFineTickets       FineTicket[]             @relation("FineTicketIssuer")
  confirmedFineTickets    FineTicket[]             @relation("FineTicketConfirmer")
  auditLogs               AuditLog[]

  @@map("users")
}

model EmailVerificationToken {
  id        Int       @id @default(autoincrement())
  userId    Int       @map("user_id")
  tokenHash String    @unique @map("token_hash") @db.VarChar(255)
  expiresAt DateTime  @map("expires_at") @db.Timestamptz
  usedAt    DateTime? @map("used_at") @db.Timestamptz
  createdAt DateTime  @default(now()) @map("created_at") @db.Timestamptz

  user User @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([userId])
  @@map("email_verification_tokens")
}

model Category {
  id        Int       @id @default(autoincrement())
  name      String    @db.VarChar(50)
  createdAt DateTime  @default(now()) @map("created_at") @db.Timestamptz
  updatedAt DateTime  @default(now()) @map("updated_at") @db.Timestamptz
  deletedAt DateTime? @map("deleted_at") @db.Timestamptz

  books Book[]

  @@map("categories")
}

model Book {
  id                Int       @id @default(autoincrement())
  title             String    @db.VarChar(100)
  author            String    @db.VarChar(100)
  publishYear       Int       @map("publish_year") @db.SmallInt
  isbn              String?   @db.VarChar(13)
  description       String    @db.VarChar(255)
  categoryId        Int       @map("category_id")
  coverPath         String?   @map("cover_path") @db.VarChar(255)
  totalQuantity     Int       @map("total_quantity")
  availableQuantity Int       @map("available_quantity")
  borrowedQuantity  Int       @default(0) @map("borrowed_quantity")
  damagedQuantity   Int       @default(0) @map("damaged_quantity")
  borrowCount       Int       @default(0) @map("borrow_count")
  version           Int       @default(1)
  createdAt         DateTime  @default(now()) @map("created_at") @db.Timestamptz
  updatedAt         DateTime  @default(now()) @map("updated_at") @db.Timestamptz
  deletedAt         DateTime? @map("deleted_at") @db.Timestamptz

  category     Category      @relation(fields: [categoryId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  borrowOrders BorrowOrder[]

  @@index([categoryId])
  @@map("books")
}

model BorrowOrder {
  id             Int          @id @default(autoincrement())
  readerId       Int          @map("reader_id")
  bookId         Int          @map("book_id")
  status         BorrowStatus @default(pending)
  requestedDays  Int          @default(14) @map("requested_days") @db.SmallInt
  processedById  Int?         @map("processed_by")
  processedAt    DateTime?    @map("processed_at") @db.Timestamptz
  rejectReason   String?      @map("reject_reason") @db.VarChar(500)
  borrowedAt     DateTime?    @map("borrowed_at") @db.Timestamptz
  dueDate        DateTime?    @map("due_date") @db.Date
  extensionCount Int          @default(0) @map("extension_count") @db.SmallInt
  extendedAt     DateTime?    @map("extended_at") @db.Timestamptz
  returnedAt     DateTime?    @map("returned_at") @db.Timestamptz
  cancelledAt    DateTime?    @map("cancelled_at") @db.Timestamptz
  createdAt      DateTime     @default(now()) @map("created_at") @db.Timestamptz
  updatedAt      DateTime     @default(now()) @map("updated_at") @db.Timestamptz

  reader         User            @relation("BorrowOrderReader", fields: [readerId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  book           Book            @relation(fields: [bookId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  processedBy    User?           @relation("BorrowOrderProcessor", fields: [processedById], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  returnRequests ReturnRequest[]
  fineTickets    FineTicket[]

  @@index([status, createdAt])
  @@index([readerId, status])
  @@index([bookId, status])
  @@index([status, dueDate])
  @@index([processedById])
  @@map("borrow_orders")
}

model ReturnRequest {
  id            Int            @id @default(autoincrement())
  borrowOrderId Int            @map("borrow_order_id")
  status        ReturnStatus   @default(pending)
  requestedById Int            @map("requested_by")
  processedById Int?           @map("processed_by")
  processedAt   DateTime?      @map("processed_at") @db.Timestamptz
  condition     BookCondition?
  conditionNote String?        @map("condition_note") @db.VarChar(500)
  lateDays      Int?           @map("late_days") @db.SmallInt
  rejectReason  String?        @map("reject_reason") @db.VarChar(500)
  cancelledAt   DateTime?      @map("cancelled_at") @db.Timestamptz
  createdAt     DateTime       @default(now()) @map("created_at") @db.Timestamptz
  updatedAt     DateTime       @default(now()) @map("updated_at") @db.Timestamptz

  borrowOrder BorrowOrder  @relation(fields: [borrowOrderId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  requestedBy User         @relation("ReturnRequestRequester", fields: [requestedById], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  processedBy User?        @relation("ReturnRequestProcessor", fields: [processedById], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  fineTickets FineTicket[]

  @@index([status, createdAt])
  @@index([requestedById])
  @@index([processedById])
  @@map("return_requests")
}

model FineTier {
  id        Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  name      String   @db.VarChar(25)
  type      FineType
  amount    Int
  isActive  Boolean  @default(true) @map("is_active")
  createdAt DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at") @db.Timestamptz
  updatedAt DateTime @default(now()) @map("updated_at") @db.Timestamptz

  fineTickets FineTicket[]

  @@index([type, isActive])
  @@map("fine_tiers")
}

model FineTicket {
  id              Int        @id @default(autoincrement())
  readerId        Int        @map("reader_id")
  borrowOrderId   Int        @map("borrow_order_id")
  returnRequestId Int        @map("return_request_id")
  fineTierId      Int        @map("fine_tier_id")
  type            FineType
  tierName        String     @map("tier_name") @db.VarChar(25)
  amount          Int
  note            String?    @db.VarChar(500)
  status          FineStatus @default(unpaid)
  issuedAt        DateTime   @default(now()) @map("issued_at") @db.Timestamptz
  issuedById      Int        @map("issued_by")
  submittedAt     DateTime?  @map("submitted_at") @db.Timestamptz
  receiptPath     String?    @map("receipt_path") @db.VarChar(255)
  confirmedById   Int?       @map("confirmed_by")
  confirmedAt     DateTime?  @map("confirmed_at") @db.Timestamptz
  rejectReason    String?    @map("reject_reason") @db.VarChar(500)
  rejectedAt      DateTime?  @map("rejected_at") @db.Timestamptz
  createdAt       DateTime   @default(now()) @map("created_at") @db.Timestamptz
  updatedAt       DateTime   @default(now()) @map("updated_at") @db.Timestamptz

  reader        User          @relation("FineTicketReader", fields: [readerId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  borrowOrder   BorrowOrder   @relation(fields: [borrowOrderId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  returnRequest ReturnRequest @relation(fields: [returnRequestId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  fineTier      FineTier      @relation(fields: [fineTierId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  issuedBy      User          @relation("FineTicketIssuer", fields: [issuedById], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  confirmedBy   User?         @relation("FineTicketConfirmer", fields: [confirmedById], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)

  @@unique([returnRequestId, type], map: "fine_tickets_return_request_type_key")
  @@index([readerId, status])
  @@index([status, submittedAt])
  @@index([issuedAt])
  @@index([borrowOrderId])
  @@index([fineTierId])
  @@index([issuedById])
  @@index([confirmedById])
  @@map("fine_tickets")
}

model AuditLog {
  id         Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  actorId    Int      @map("actor_id")
  action     String   @db.VarChar(50)
  entityType String   @map("entity_type") @db.VarChar(50)
  entityId   Int      @map("entity_id")
  oldValue   Json?    @map("old_value")
  newValue   Json?    @map("new_value")
  createdAt  DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at") @db.Timestamptz

  actor User @relation(fields: [actorId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)

  @@index([entityType, entityId])
  @@index([actorId, createdAt])
  @@map("audit_logs")
}
